    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Henry Kee & Son are delighted to present to the market this well-maintained family home located on the outskirts of Convoy village. Occupying an elevated site, the bungalow has parking plus a garden area to the front with a spacious and private rear garden. Internal accommodation comprises of sitting room, dining room, kitchen, three double bedrooms and family bathroom. The present owners have carried out a number of home improvements in recent years, including fitting a new kitchen plus fully replacing the bathroom fittings and tiles. Strong interest in this property is expected therefore early viewing is recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "<br><br>\nEntrance Hall - 4.75m x 1.5m <br>PVC front door with glass side panel. \nCentre three-stem ceiling light. \nFloor tiled. <br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.3m x 3.6m <br>Insert stove with back boiler. \nLaminate timber floor. \nBuilt-in display unit. \nFront facing window. <br><br><br>\nKitchen - 4.3m x 3m <br>High and low level kitchen units. \nElectric oven and gas hob.\nChrome extractor unit. \nStainless steel sink.\nBreakfast counter. \nTwo windows overlooking back garden. \nFloor tiled. \nOpen arch into dining room. <br><br><br>\nDining Room - 3.6m x 2.9m <br>Patio door with side window to back garden. \nFloor tiled. \nPlumbed for washing machine and tumbledryer. <br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4.3m x 4m <br>Front facing window.\nLaminate timber floor. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 4m x 3.7m <br>Front facing window. \nLaminate timber floor. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 3.5m x 3m <br>Window overlooking rear garden. \nLaminate timber floor. <br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2m x 1.8m <br>WC, WHB and bath. \nElectric shower over bath. \nFloor and walls fully tiled. \nGrosflex sheeting on ceiling. \nMirror with in-built light over WHB. <br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Constructed before the defective block period. \nDual-fuel central heating - oil plus a solid fuel stove. \nRecently fitted kitchen and bathroom. \nThree double bedrooms. \nPrivate rear lawn/garden, ideal for kids. \nConvenient edge of town location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment"
      }
    ],
